【来源1】{"claim": "Maria's notes gave John new ideas and plans for the community.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-09T19:06:00+00:00", "text": "John: Thanks, Maria! You're super helpful. That gives me some new ideas and plans for our community!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源2】{"claim": "John states his kids have so much while others don't, and that something needs to be done about it.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-28T13:17:00+00:00", "text": "John: It's definitely isn't, Maria. My kids have so much and others don't. We really need to do something about it.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源3】{"claim": "John has been busy with work and family.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-09T19:06:00+00:00", "text": "John: [Image: a photo of a car with a broken windshield and a broken windshield] Hey Maria, I've been busy with work and family, but last week I had an unexpected incident on my way home. It reminded me how life can throw unexpected troubles our way.", "context_only": false, "time_derivations": [{"expression": "last week", "start": "2023-01-02", "end_exclusive": "2023-01-09", "precision": "week", "rule": "iso_monday_week"}]}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源4】{"claim": "John agrees they should fight for more money and resources for schools.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-28T13:17:00+00:00", "text": "John: Yup, education is essential for a successful society. I totally agree that we should fight for more money and resources for our schools. It breaks my heart that our kids don't have the proper stuff they need. They deserve better.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源5】{"claim": "John is brainstorming initiatives to help underserved communities get access to education, mentorship, job training, and resume building, with the goal of empowering individuals to achieve their aspirations.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "planned", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-01T20:30:00+00:00", "text": "John: We're brainstorming some to help underserved communities get access to education, mentorship, job training, and resume building. The goal is to empower individuals in achieving their aspirations.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源6】{"claim": "Maria states that uniting is essential for making a difference and that standing together lets them tackle any problems and build a great community.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Maria", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-09T19:06:00+00:00", "text": "Maria: Agreed, John! Uniting is essential for making a difference. if we stand together we can tackle any problems and build a great community.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源7】{"claim": "Maria agrees to work together with John, saying that as a team they can bring positive changes to the neighborhood.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Maria", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-09T19:06:00+00:00", "text": "Maria: Yeah, let's do it, John! Working together, we can bring positive changes to the neighborhood as a team.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源8】{"claim": "Maria proposes fighting for more money and resources for schools and raising awareness about the importance of education.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "planned", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Maria", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-28T13:17:00+00:00", "text": "Maria: Hey John, cool that you made it. You're right, it's really sad to see the state of education. We should fight for more money and resources for schools and raise awareness about the importance of education. It's not just for our kids, but for all of us too!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源9】{"claim": "John's service-focused group held events where they met people, including going to a homeless shelter to give out food and supplies.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-01T20:30:00+00:00", "text": "John: We held some events and got to meet some people. We went to a homeless shelter to give out food and supplies. Seeing the smiles on their faces, we knew we made a real difference. We also organized a toy drive for kids in need. It was amazing seeing the community come together to spread some joy.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源10】{"claim": "John's interest in education and infrastructure stems from growing up seeing how lack of education and crumbling infrastructure affected his neighborhood.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-12-17T11:01:00+00:00", "text": "John: [Image: a photo of a group of men working on a building] Growing up, I saw how lack of education and crumbling infrastructure affected my neighborhood. I don't want future generations to go through that, so I think schools and infrastructure should be funded properly. Here's a pic of a school last year, after they got the funding.", "context_only": false, "time_derivations": [{"expression": "last year", "start": "2021-01-01", "end_exclusive": "2022-01-01", "precision": "year", "rule": "source_relative_year"}]}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源11】{"claim": "John says Maria's encouragement means a lot to him and that with effort and support they can make a real difference in their community.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-12-22T18:10:00+00:00", "text": "John: Thanks, Maria. Your encouragement means a lot to me. It's true that with effort and support, we can make a real difference in our community.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源12】{"claim": "John's family helps him stay centered and reminds him why he is passionate about making a positive impact.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-12-22T18:10:00+00:00", "text": "John: Thanks, Maria. They really help me stay centered. They remind me why I'm so passionate about making a positive impact.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源13】{"claim": "John has a community meeting next week where education and infrastructure upgrades will be discussed.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "planned", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-09T19:06:00+00:00", "text": "John: Next week I have a community meeting coming up, we'll be discussing education and infrastructure upgrades.", "context_only": false, "time_derivations": [{"expression": "Next week", "start": "2023-01-16", "end_exclusive": "2023-01-23", "precision": "week", "rule": "iso_monday_week"}]}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源14】{"claim": "John found the community meeting interesting, hearing everyone's worries about how it affects the area.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-28T13:17:00+00:00", "text": "John: [Image: a photo of a wooden floor with a white wall and a wooden floor] Hey Maria, since we last spoke I went to that community mtg. It was really interesting hearing everyone's worries and how it affects our area. It made me realize how crucial the upgrades are, especially for the kids. I'm really upset seeing the state of our education. How do you think we can make things better?", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源15】{"claim": "John's family is his rock in tough times and always cheers him on; he is thankful for their love.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-12-22T18:10:00+00:00", "text": "John: [Image: a photography of a family enjoying a ride on a swing] Yeah, they are my rock in tough times and always cheer me on. I'm really thankful for their love. Family time means a lot to me.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源16】{"claim": "John's family is the reason he never gives up, and their love gives him strength.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-12-22T18:10:00+00:00", "text": "John: [Image: a photography of a family having a picnic in the park] Thanks a lot, Maria. Your help is really motivating and makes me more determined. Here's a pic of my family - they're the reason why I never give up. Their love gives me strength.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源17】{"claim": "John believes investing in future generations is key, giving them the right tools for success, and calls it the foundation of progress and opportunity.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-12-22T18:10:00+00:00", "text": "John: Definitely, Maria. Investing in our future generations is key, giving them the right tools for success. It's the foundation of progress and opportunity.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
